  "description": "<p>On fcrepo-webapp-plus, when running: <br/>\nmvn clean install -Paudit</p>\n\n<p>The SanityIT fails with:<br/>\nSanityIT.doASanityCheckNoAuth:86 expected:&lt;401&gt; but was:&lt;200&gt;</p>\n\n<p>Regardless of which profile(s) the project is built with, the sanity should test to run successfully.</p>\n\n<p>This ticket will be resolved with the following four commands complete successfully:<br/>\nmvn clean install<br/>\nmvn clean install -Prbacl<br/>\nmvn clean install -Pxacml<br/>\nmvn clean install -Paudit</p>",
